# 12. Statistical Analysis

## 12.1 Pairing

配对单位：

```text
task × model × replicate
```

每个单位同时包含五个 conditions。

## 12.2 P1 Binary Reward

报告：

```text
paired risk difference
task-cluster bootstrap 95% CI
paired permutation/randomization p-value
McNemar cross-check
```

Mixed-effects logistic regression 仅作 sensitivity：

```text
reward ~ condition + model + domain + task_type + (1|task)
```

## 12.3 P2 Tool Count

报告：

```text
paired mean difference
paired median difference
task-cluster bootstrap CI
paired permutation test
```

Negative-binomial mixed model 仅作 sensitivity。

## 12.4 Heterogeneity

必须报告：

```text
per-model effect
per-domain effect
per-task-type effect
condition × model
condition × domain
condition × task_type
```

但 heterogeneity 属 secondary，除非预注册 interaction test 通过。

## 12.5 Concentration与影响

```text
top-1/top-2/top-5 task contribution
Herfindahl concentration
leave-one-task-out
leave-one-domain-out
leave-one-model-out
leave-one-template-out
```

任何正向结论若由 top-2 tasks 贡献超过 40%，必须降级为 unstable。

